# Normalize line endings: source files are always LF in the repo AND in
# every checkout, regardless of the machine's core.autocrlf. Without this,
# GitHub's Windows runners (autocrlf=true) check out CRLF files and
# Prettier's default endOfLine=lf fails on every file — while local checks
# pass. One source of truth ends that class of "works on my machine".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
